1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Viśvāmitra had turned to go.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Vasiṣṭha stood up.

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
He told the king: a man of
this house keeps his word.

4
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:17,000
Then he told him: the sage he
refused was Rāma's protection.

5
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,200
Dasharatha called for his son.

6
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,200
And gave him.
